cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use OpenTrials in research, please cite the software using these metadata."
title: "OpenTrials"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OpenTrials contributors"
abstract: >-
  OpenTrials is open-source infrastructure for reproducible mechanistic
  virtual clinical-trial research. It provides model capability registration,
  verified simulation execution, immutable provenance-bearing artifacts,
  population and multi-arm trial workflows, PK analysis, evidence ingestion,
  validation infrastructure, and researcher-facing reports around compatible
  mechanistic simulation engines.
version: "1.0.0-rc.2"
date-released: "2026-08-19"
license: "Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/eshkanala/OpenTrials"
url: "https://github.com/eshkanala/OpenTrials"
keywords:
  - "virtual clinical trials"
  - "PBPK"
  - "pharmacometrics"
  - "pharmacokinetics"
  - "systems pharmacology"
  - "computational pharmacology"
  - "mechanistic modeling"
  - "scientific computing"
  - "research software"
  - "reproducibility"
